edition 6;

module ml.wireio;

// predict and eval for the models that go through the pipeline (docs/wiring.md section 3). A constant model is handed to tools/ml/verbs.cho unchanged.
// The stored steps are applied, never a plan: the only description of the transformation is the model file.

